BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:prohelvetia-she-got-game-switzerland-2026@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261104T150309Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270901
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270902
SUMMARY:Deadline: Game Design Emerging Talents: She Got Game (Switzerland)
DESCRIPTION:She Got Game is a Pro Helvetia mentoring programme promoting eq
 ual opportunities for women in the Swiss and international game industry\,
  supporting the representation of women in management positions through di
 alogue with experienced international experts.\n\nOrganisation: Pro Helvet
 ia (Swiss Arts Council)\nLocation: Professional game designers from Switze
 rland who identify as women.\nAward: CHF 3\,000 toward prototype/demo prod
 uction\, plus mentoring\, community access\, and potential trade-fair acce
 ss\; up to CHF 250 per week childcare support for international events. No
  application fee.\nDuration: Six-month mentoring programme (approximately 
 30 hours total)\; notification November 2027. Next application window 1 Ju
 ly to 1 September 2027.\n\nMore: https://prohelvetia.ch/en/find-support/ga
 me-design-emerging-talents-she-got-game?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantd
 esk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://prohelvetia.ch/en/find-support/game-design-emerging-talents-she
 -got-game?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Professional game designers from Switzerland who identify as women
 .
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:eth-ai-center-fellowships-2027@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261104T150309Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261027
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261028
SUMMARY:Deadline: ETH AI Center Doctoral and Postdoctoral Fellowships 2027
DESCRIPTION:The ETH AI Center's flagship fellowship programme funds doctora
 l and postdoctoral researchers doing interdisciplinary AI research\, eithe
 r within AI foundations or between AI foundations and application areas\, 
 including safe and trustworthy AI. Fellows are co-supervised across ETH gr
 oups and join the AI Center's community.\n\nOrganisation: ETH AI Center\, 
 ETH Zurich\nLocation: Zurich\, Switzerland. In person at ETH Zurich.\nAwar
 d: Doctoral fellowship: CHF 73\,100 (year 1)\, CHF 78\,300 (year 2)\, CHF 
 83\,500 (year 3). Postdoc fellowship: CHF 92\,500 (year 1)\, CHF 97\,200 (
 year 2). No application fee.\nDuration: About 3 years (doctoral\, extendab
 le by up to 1 year) or 2 years (postdoc)\, starting around September 2027.
 \n\nMore: https://ai.ethz.ch/research/phd-and-postdoc-programs.html?utm_so
 urce=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://ai.ethz.ch/research/phd-and-postdoc-programs.html?utm_source=ar
 tificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Zurich\, Switzerland. In person at ETH Zurich.
END:VEVENT
