SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 CET: TRACES Art & Science @ Energypolis 2027: reside
 ncy at the EPFL Laboratory for Energy Materials (Sion)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 22 Nov 2026 at 23:59 CET.\n\nTRACES is a new art and sci
 ence residency run by the Foundation for the Sustainable Development of Mo
 untain Regions (FDDM) with EPFL Valais-Wallis\, Energypolis\, the City of 
 Sion and the Canton of Valais. The 2027 pilot embeds one visual artist for
  three months in Prof.\n\nOrganisation: Foundation for the Sustainable Dev
 elopment of Mountain Regions (FDDM) with EPFL Valais-Wallis\nLocation: Ene
 rgypolis campus\, Sion\, Valais\, Switzerland. In person.\nAward: Artist s
 tipend of CHF 2\,000 per month (CHF 6\,000 total) covering living and rese
 arch costs\, housing in Sion\, travel from home and back up to CHF 1\,500\
 , and a separate production budget set by the curator. No application fee.
 \nDuration: Three months\, 11 January to 18 April 2027.\n\nMore: https://w
 ww.traces-opencall.ch/en?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=
 referral
